# rclone exclude patterns for gdrive-sync (one per line, --exclude-from).
# Root-anchored (leading /) because gdrive-sync's built-in **/<dir>/** patterns
# only catch NESTED copies — a TOP-LEVEL regenerable tree slips through. These
# are all rebuildable (uv/pip, git clone, test caches) so they don't belong in
# the Drive backup; the precious bits (data/edfs.db, .env, models/) still sync.
/.venv/**
/.git/**
/__pycache__/**
/.pytest_cache/**
/.mypy_cache/**
/.ruff_cache/**
/build/**
/node_modules/**
/.next/**
